                           pushstring "小赛尔"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "斯坦因！被你推下去之后，我就被传送到了这里！！我想起来了！！"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "......"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushbyte 106
                           pushstring "斯坦因"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "很对，那么，巴蒂呢？她去了哪里？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "是啊……巴蒂去了哪里？"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 400
                           pushstring "小赛尔"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "（一时语塞）巴蒂她……她……我想不起来了，大概被传送回飞船了吧？我不知道……"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "要不我问问她？"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 3100
                           pushstring "风暴伊特"
                           pushbyte 0
